              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us</th></tr><tr><td>The patient’s CD3+CD4+ (T4 helper) cell count is mildly decreased, which may indicate transient or chronic immunosuppression. Clinical correlation is recommended to assess for possible causes such as recent infection, medication effects, or underlying immune disorders. Consider follow-up testing if clinically indicated.</td></tr></table></div>"
